    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Can you expand on the idea of the 'political economy of a few dominant states'? Like, how does that actually play out in practice when a country wants to prioritize its own economic or security needs over these global mandates?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
