    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It sounds like the whole system is basically rigged for the big players then. Given how much these \"global norms\" seem to just serve whoever has the most power, wouldn't you say that true national sovereignty is basically impossible to maintain within this current internationalist framework?",
